Healers of Erenor look to Kyprosa, the unloved daughter of a mad King. A symbol of love and health, she is the figure behind the skills of Vitalism.

'''Vitalism''' is the healing [[Skill Trees|skill tree]]. It restores health with direct heals, heals over time and group heals, revives fallen allies and restores mana, and it adds blessings and cleanses for the party. It is usually paired with trees that adds crowd control, survivability or further healing.

== Skills ==
=== Combat skills ===
{{TreeSkills|Vitalism|combat}}

=== Passive skills ===
Passives cost 1 skill point each and unlock after you have spent the listed number of points in Vitalism.
{{TreeSkills|Vitalism|passives}}

=== Abyssal skills ===
The [[Abyssal Skills]] have to be unlocked through a questline and don't require skill points to be used.
{{TreeSkills|Vitalism|abyssal}}

